<h2>The pricing question</h2>

<p>ClickFunnels is not cheap for what it delivers. At $147 per month for the Basic plan, you are paying more than DUSA costs for the full platform. And you are getting a funnel builder with limited extras. The Pro plan at $197 adds more funnels and some additional features, but it still does not give you review management, native SMS, or a full-featured CRM.</p>

<p>With DUSA, $97 per month gets you everything. Funnels, CRM, email, SMS, automation, booking, reviews, pipeline management. There are no tiers to navigate and no features locked behind higher plans.</p>

<p>For a small business owner watching every dollar, paying less and getting more is not a difficult decision.</p>

<h2>When ClickFunnels is the better choice</h2>

<p>ClickFunnels is the better choice if funnels are the core of your business and you do not need much beyond them. If you are a digital course creator, an info product seller, or a coach whose entire business model runs through webinar funnels and checkout pages, ClickFunnels was purpose-built for you.</p>

<p>If you already have a CRM you love, an email tool that works, and a booking system in place, and you just need a dedicated funnel builder to plug into that stack, ClickFunnels is a strong option. It does its primary job very well.</p>

<blockquote><p>The right tool is not always the one that does the most. Sometimes it is the one that does the thing you need better than anything else. But most small businesses need more than one thing.</p></blockquote>

<h2>When DUSA is the better choice</h2>

<p>DUSA is the better choice if you need more than funnels. If you are a service-based business, a local operator, or a small team that needs to manage leads, send follow-ups, book appointments, collect reviews, and run automations, DUSA gives you all of that without stitching together separate tools.</p>

<p>It is also the better choice if you want to simplify. Instead of paying for ClickFunnels plus a CRM plus an email tool plus a booking system plus a review platform, you pay for one thing. One login, one bill, one place where everything connects.</p>

<p>If the idea of replacing five tools with one appeals to you, DUSA was built for exactly that situation.</p>

